# OpenSpec (https://github.com/Fission-AI/OpenSpec) writes its own per-harness
# skill content directly into BOTH .claude/skills/ and .agents/skills/ (the
# tree Codex and Antigravity share) — the two copies differ deliberately (e.g.
# Claude's `/opsx:apply` vs the generic `$openspec-apply-change` invocation
# hint), so this compatibility layer must not try to symlink them together.
# Regenerated by `openspec update` (task spec:update); do not hand-merge.
openspec-apply-change
openspec-archive-change
openspec-explore
openspec-propose
openspec-sync-specs
openspec-update-change
